      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with gallstone pain at this stage.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:28",
      "end_timestamp": "04:35",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's gallstone pain, and we'll know more once the liver function tests is back. Let's get liver function tests, for right upper quadrant pain. Smaller, lower-fat meals will probably keep the pain down until we've seen the scan. Come back in two weeks.",
